Package: rbig
Type: Package
Title: A toolbox for R programmers for working with huge size wide tables and data-frames.
Version: 1.3.5
Date: 2026-11-25
Author: Nicolas Berta
Maintainer: Nicolas Berta <nicolas.berta@gmail.com>
Description: This package provides a useful general library of R functions 
  required for working with huge tables (big data).
  This packages provides a reference class named WIDETABLE which can be used for
  working with huge data frames having numerous columns.
